  "final_message": "The root cause was in `due_for_retry` in `billing/dunning.py`. It filtered invoices on `status == \"opened\"`, but the real status value is `\"open\"`. No invoice ever matched, so declined payments were never picked up for retry. The subscription therefore stayed `past_due`.\n\nI changed the filter to `\"open\"`. All 24 tests pass and mypy reports no issues. I didn't add a test for this case.\n\nI also wrote `answer.json` in the repository root: `{\"file\": \"dunning.py\", \"function\": \"due_for_retry\"}`.",
